  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Desk appraisal of Market based medium-scale agri-food focused biogas programme Engagement under the Kenyan Bilateral Programme 2021-2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the current assignment will be two-fold:
- A short assessment of the draft appraisal carried out by the Dutch MFA to include issues of relevance for the Danish considerations for supporting the initiative (to be provided by 6th November 2020)
- A desk appraisal of the Danish contribution to the final programme (expected to be provided by end December 2020 based on the final programme documentation, including the Dutch appraisal)</narrative>
